<reference id="tagdictionary-SmartTagDictionary" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">tagdictionary-SmartTagDictionary</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">The Smart tag dictionary automatically applies the implied
